==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Eelektross|46}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion.
*{{m|Thunder Fang}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Eelektross}} can learn via [[TM]] in [[Generation IX]].
